[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0567","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56758","title":"Linux Kernel btrfs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 relocate_one_folio() 函数中存在条件竞争漏洞。当调用 btrfs_read_folio() 读取 folio 时，该 folio 会被解锁，此时其他线程可能通过 invalidate_inode_pages2() 修改映射并将 mapping 置为 NULL。若后续未重新检查 folio 映射有效性就直接调用 set_extent_mapping()，将导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过并发触发 btrfs 块组重定位与事务中止操作来利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56758"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40.597","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55.433","remediation":"建议立即升级内核至修复版本：SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 Azure 内核升级至 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 版本，SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP7 升级至 SUSE-SU-2025:01967-1 或 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 版本，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 USN-7381-1 提供的内核版本，Debian 12 升级至 DSA-5973 提供的内核版本，Microsoft CBL-Mariner/Azure Linux 升级至 AZL-55032 修复版本。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时卸载或禁用 btrfs 文件系统模块（modprobe -r btrfs 并加入黑名单 /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-btrfs.conf），或避免在 btrfs 卷上执行 balance/relocate 操作作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36679fab54fa7bcffafd469e2c474c1fc4beaee0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e74859ee35edc33a022c3f3971df066ea0ca6b9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c7b1bd52a031ad0144d42eef0ba8471ce75122dd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d508e56270389b3a16f5b3cf247f4eb1bbad1578","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56758.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56758","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56758.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56758.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56758-2025-11-03-1121","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56758","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-55032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0566","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56757","title":"Linux 内核 btusb 驱动 USB 断开时接口未释放导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统 btusb 驱动中，MediaTek 芯片组为 ISO 数据传输声明了一个专用 USB 中断接口，但在 USB 断开连接时未正确释放该接口即注销 HCI 设备，导致资源释放顺序错误。本地具有低权限的攻击者可通过物理移除 MediaTek 蓝牙 USB 适配器触发此缺陷，造成内核崩溃（Kernel Panic），导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 MediaTek 蓝牙芯片的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56757"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40.297","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55.290","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8 或更高版本（6.13 已包含修复），或合入补丁 commit cc569d791ab2a / 489304e67087。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户执行 `apt update && apt install linux-image-$(uname -r | sed 's/-generic//')-generic` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。临时缓解措施：避免在蓝牙 ISO 数据传输过程中热拔插 MediaTek BT USB 适配器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/489304e67087abddc2666c5af0159cb95afdcf59","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc569d791ab2a0de74f76e470515d25d24c9b84b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56757.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56757","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-56757.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/881714b7d8a541e04c5fbc03cede9cc635f1aa2c/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-gw7h-65mp-jqvp/GHSA-gw7h-65mp-jqvp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56757","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56757.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0566.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0010","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11148","title":"OpenBSD httpd(8) fastcgi 请求处理空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD httpd(8) 在处理格式错误的 fastcgi 请求时存在空指针解引用漏洞。当攻击者向受影响版本的 OpenBSD httpd 服务器发送特制的畸形 fastcgi 请求时，程序未能正确校验指针便进行解引用操作，导致守护进程崩溃并触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 7.4（低于修正补丁 006）及 OpenBSD 7.3（低于修正补丁 020）。攻击者无需身份认证，只需能与 httpd 服务端口建立网络连接即可远程发起攻击，利用方式是通过构造不符合协议的 fastcgi 报文使服务不可用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11148"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-12-05T20:15:21.577","updated":"2026-06-17T06:57:10.263","remediation":"升级到已修复版本：OpenBSD 7.4 应用 2024 年 1 月发布的 errata 006 补丁，或 OpenBSD 7.3 应用 errata 020 补丁（执行 sysmerge 并重新编译/更新 httpd 二进制）；如暂无法打补丁，可在 httpd.conf 中通过限制 fastcgi 后端仅接受来自本地/可信网络的请求、或在前端反向代理处过滤畸形 fastcgi 请求以缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/7.3/common/020_httpd.patch.sig","https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/7.4/common/006_httpd.patch.sig","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bd8147c9eb98061a73ac3211bfcd9edfb4e5605b/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-2024-11148.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/760f2a0ac5ec983dd84c5e09cb5339a52f81c82b/docs/2026/OpenBSD_httpd_fastcgi_NULL_%E8%A7%A3%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2024-11148.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2024/12/GHSA-6xw3-v997-r9fc/GHSA-6xw3-v997-r9fc.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-11148.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/0e35d8bfdac0b27bd17f876ef30e25bea2c2e02d/CVEs_log/2024-12-06_zh.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--472bd70c-93e6-4470-ac18-c1af86a984d5.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/b6cfdffaf454975251cf1f60982a431e914883e8/CNAReports/cisa-cg.csv","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-11148"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0009","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-10500","title":"绿盟亿赛通 CDG HookWhiteListService SQL 注入漏洞","description":"绿盟亿赛通（ESAFENET）CDG 数据泄露防护系统 5 版本在 /com/esafenet/servlet/policy/HookWhiteListService.java 中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该接口对用户传入的 policyId 参数未做有效过滤与参数化校验，攻击者可构造包含恶意 SQL 片段（如注入 WAITFOR DELAY 延时语句）的请求，向 /CDGServer3/policy/HookWhiteList;logindojojs 接口发起远程未授权访问，从而探测数据库名、执行任意 SQL 查询并可能导致数据库信息泄露。此漏洞可经网络远程利用，无需身份认证，CVSS 评分为 5.3，危害等级为中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-10500"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-10-30T01:15:02.803","updated":"2026-06-17T06:55:48.483","remediation":"建议升级到 ESAFENET CDG 官方已修复该 SQL 注入漏洞的版本（联系厂商获取 CDG 5 后续补丁/安全版本）。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中拦截对 /com/esafenet/servlet/policy/HookWhiteListService 路径含 policyId 参数的恶意请求，并对 policyId 参数做严格白名单校验与预编译参数化查询，同时限制该接口仅允许内网可信地址访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://flowus.cn/share/a582f7be-7e33-41f1-bce9-a1eb3578229f?code=G8A6P3","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.282440","https://vuldb.com/?id.282440","https://vuldb.com/?submit.427397","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bd8147c9eb98061a73ac3211bfcd9edfb4e5605b/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-2024-10500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2024/10/GHSA-xgxf-923g-4wjc/GHSA-xgxf-923g-4wjc.json","https://github.com/dholdaway/AI-Web-Scraper/blob/9d4bfeff24174d1776d2dafe28e134f316fef3a3/ollama_crawler/cve_results/CVE-2024-10487/secondary_content/CVE-2024-10500_secondary.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--579b26f4-636d-4873-8ca1-078ae5c8e36f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/6fab7ea6c1d74d21cbcf0ffe9da81cc6b978c360/advisories/2024/10/EUVD-2024-33152.json","https://github.com/password123456/nvd-cve-database/blob/60fbe1ba6ab41a303e40d274bf566bb1d2b794d3/2024/2024-10/2024-10-30/20241030_1730253626.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-10500"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0007","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0007.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"浙江大华 智能云网关注册管理平台 SQL注入漏洞","description":"浙江大华技术股份有限公司智能云网关注册管理平台的登录接口存在SQL注入漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者通过向/index.php/User/doLogin接口发送特制POST请求，在username参数中构造恶意SQL语句，利用updatexml报错函数可触发数据库错误回显，从而窃取数据库中的敏感信息，如管理员凭证、用户数据等。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2024-CNVD-2024-38747-YAML","CNVD-2024-38747"],"sources":["cnvd","nuclei"],"published":"2024-10-22","updated":"2024-10-23","remediation":"厂商已发布安全更新，建议用户立即升级智能云网关注册管理平台至最新版本；同时应在Web应用防火墙上配置规则拦截含updatexml、extractvalue等报错注入特征的POST请求，并改用参数化查询或预编译语句处理用户输入，防止SQL注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cnvd/2024/CNVD-2024-38747.yaml","https://blog.csdn.net/qq_39894062/article/details/142982815"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0158","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0158.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"新华三 H3C iMC 智能管理中心 autoDeploy.xhtml 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"新华三（H3C）智能管理中心（iMC）是一款综合网络管理产品。其autoDeploy.xhtml接口存在未授权远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向/imc/dc3dtopo/dc2dtopo/autoDeploy.xhtml发送特制POST请求，利用JSF ViewState表达式注入执行任意系统命令，无需认证即可完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响iMC全系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-021e7b53"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-10-11","updated":"2026-07-18","remediation":"官方尚未发布正式补丁，建议用户升级H3C iMC至最新版本。临时缓解措施包括：限制/imc路径的访问权限，配置Web应用防火墙拦截对autoDeploy.xhtml的异常POST请求，或在不影响业务的情况下删除autoDeploy.xhtml文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T07:34:11.328017752+00:00","references":["https://github.com/zhiang225/H3C-IMC-autoDeploy","https://github.com/Y-my-HH/H3C-IMC-autoDeploy"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/zhiang225/H3C-IMC-autoDeploy"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0499","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-36137","title":"Node.js Permission Model 文件权限检查绕过漏洞","description":"Node.js 实验性权限模型（Permission Model）中存在不完整的权限分配修复漏洞。当使用 `--allow-fs-write` 标志限制文件写入权限时，Promise 版本的 `FileHandle.chmod()` 和 `FileHandle.chown()` 方法未正确实施权限检查，而回调版本的 `fs.fchmod()` 和 `fs.fchown()` 已正确修复。攻击者可通过已打开的只读文件描述符调用 Promise API 修改文件权限和所有者，从而绕过预期的写入限制。该漏洞影响 Node.js 20.x、22.x、24.x 及 25.x 版本，CVSS 评分 3.3，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-36137"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-09-07T16:15:02.410","updated":"2026-06-17T07:36:10.207","remediation":"升级 Node.js 至 v20.15.1 或 v22.4.1 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复 FileHandle.chmod()/chown() 绕过权限模型检查的问题。如无法立即升级，可在启动时移除 --allow-fs-write 标志，或避免在受限权限模式下使用 Promise 风格的 FileHandle 方法操作文件描述符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/july-2024-security-releases","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20241122-0005/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-36137.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36137.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-36137.json","https://github.com/nodejs/nodejs.org/blob/2275f25939126c3b62ef0cbe8c522b606d712422/apps/site/pages/en/blog/release/v22.4.1.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/732ddc3c16e26fec314a5183f875a1419ee98d36/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-36137","https://github.com/reddelexc/hackerone-reports/blob/420e41078cd65f59f446c2dc4b337051e83055bc/docs/tops_by_program/TOPNODEJS.md","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/f57e06c0c7b224221d0799ea8cea7dd8215a9a29/osv/node/CVE-2024-36137.json.sha256","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-36137.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/main/nodejs/APKBUILD","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-36137.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0499.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0085","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0085.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友NC任意文件上传漏洞","description":"用友NC系统的/uapim/upload/grouptemplet接口存在任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可在未认证情况下发送特制的multipart请求，上传包含恶意JSP代码的WebShell文件。由于服务端未对上传文件的类型与内容做有效校验，攻击者可借此实现远程代码执行，获取服务器控制权，造成数据泄露与系统被控等严重后果，攻击门槛低且影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-00eacd7f"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-30","updated":"2024-08-30","remediation":"升级用友NC至官方发布的安全补丁版本（NC6.5及NC Cloud请部署厂商2024年8月后发布的安全补丁包），并临时在Nginx或WAF层面拦截对/uapim/upload/grouptemplet路径的POST请求，限制该接口仅允许受信任内网IP访问，同时禁用不必要的文件上传功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.yonyou.com/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0397","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0397.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CAGI U挖矿质押单语言系统后台imageupload任意文件上传漏洞","description":"CAGI某U挖矿质押单语言系统后台管理接口/admin/news/imageupload存在任意文件上传漏洞，未对上传文件的类型、内容进行有效过滤和校验，攻击者可在登录后台后通过POST请求上传恶意脚本文件（如PHP WebShell）至服务器。该漏洞可导致远程代码执行（RCE），攻击者可获取服务器控制权限，进而窃取、篡改系统数据或植入挖矿木马，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-053975cb"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-29","updated":"2024-08-29","remediation":"在/admin/news/imageupload接口实施文件类型白名单校验，仅允许安全的图片格式（如jpg、png、gif），并使用UUID重命名上传文件，存储路径设置为Web根目录外的不可执行目录。同时校验MIME类型与文件头魔术字节是否一致，禁止PHP、ASP、JSP等脚本文件上传。若无法修改代码，可在Web服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置该上传目录禁止执行脚本文件，并限制后台管理接口的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-08-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.hwpoc.com/vuln/HWPOC-2024-053975cb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0093","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0093.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"通天星 CMSV6 车载定位监控平台 getAlarmAppealByGuid SQL 注入漏洞","description":"通天星 CMSV6 车载定位监控平台在 alarm_appeal/getAlarmAppealByGuid 接口处理 guid 参数时未进行充分过滤与参数化查询，攻击者可构造带有时间盲注特征的 POST 请求注入恶意 SQL，导致数据库查询被篡改。该漏洞可在未授权条件下被利用，可能造成敏感数据泄露、数据篡改或进一步横向利用，影响依赖该平台的车载定位与告警业务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-011590d8"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-29","updated":"2024-08-29","remediation":"对 getAlarmAppealByGuid 接口的 guid 等入参改用预编译/参数化查询并做白名单校验；在 WAF 或网关侧拦截含 SLEEP、UNION、注释符等 SQL 注入特征的请求并限制该路径未授权访问；尽快联系通天星厂商获取并升级 CMSV6 至已修复版本，同时最小化对外暴露面与数据库账户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0056","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0056.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"联创打印机 权限绕过与配置泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于联创（Lexmark）部分打印机固件中，攻击者可在未授权情况下绕过管理接口的访问限制，读取设备配置文件与敏感信息。攻击条件为可访问目标设备的管理端口，成功利用后可获取管理员凭据并进一步控制设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-00778840"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-29","updated":"2024-08-29","remediation":"升级打印机固件至厂商发布的安全版本，并限制管理接口仅允许内网可信地址访问，禁用不必要的远程管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-08-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.lexmark.com/en_us/solutions/security/lexmark-security-advisory.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0049","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0049.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"某U挖矿质押单语言系统前台未授权修改管理员密码漏洞","description":"某U挖矿质押单语言系统的 /admin/login/setpassword 接口存在未授权访问漏洞，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可直接访问该接口，通过构造恶意请求修改管理员登录密码，进而获取系统后台完全控制权限。该漏洞攻击条件低，仅需目标系统网络可达即可利用，危害严重，可能导致用户数字资产被盗、质押数据被篡改、系统配置被恶意修改等严重后果。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-0051dccc"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-29","updated":"2024-08-29","remediation":"在 /admin/login/setpassword 接口增加管理员身份验证和会话校验机制，禁止未登录状态下直接修改密码；同时添加操作日志记录和二次确认步骤，防止未授权请求绕过。如无法立即修复，可在 Web 服务器层面对该路径添加 IP 白名单访问控制或临时禁用该接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0032","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-7954","title":"SPIP porte_plume 插件任意 PHP 代码执行漏洞","description":"SPIP 内容管理系统的 porte_plume 插件在处理 action=porte_plume_previsu 请求时，未对用户输入的 name 参数中的 Textwheel 规则进行充分过滤与转义，攻击者可构造特制的恶意请求，将任意 PHP 代码注入到临时文件中并触发其执行，从而实现未经身份验证的远程代码执行。该漏洞无需登录即可利用，攻击条件仅为目标站点启用了 porte_plume 插件且能访问其前置接口，危害极大，可导致服务器被完全控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-7954"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-23T18:15:07.677","updated":"2026-06-17T08:21:16.220","remediation":"升级 SPIP 至 4.30-alpha2、4.2.13 或 4.1.16 及以上版本，或卸载 porte_plume 插件。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 /index.php?action=porte_plume_previsu 路径的 POST 请求访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.spip.net/Mise-a-jour-critique-de-securite-sortie-de-SPIP-4-3-0-alpha2-SPIP-4-2-13-SPIP-4.html","https://thinkloveshare.com/hacking/spip_preauth_rce_2024_part_1_the_feather/","https://vulncheck.com/advisories/spip-porte-plume","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-7954.yaml","https://github.com/zxj-hub/CVE-2024-7954POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/2024/CVE-2024-7954.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e6cc3f1bf08fb0aa3b8d0e7d9611aa721f0170d0/2024/CVE-2024-7954.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2cb2ea94fc4258318a8ccfcb4f378f44a19d8782/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-7954.yaml","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/SPIP/SPIP%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6porte_plume%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8FPHP%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-7954).md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/2fbbe64cf8d86ee050b5f06f2e71a66c79fdc04d/2024/CVE-2024-7954/CVE-2024-7954.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/f2d8746b54a53c370f93ab78a832a80928718678/data/2024/CVE-2024-7954-issamjr_CVE-2024-7954.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-7954.rules","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/887b19465e0912159dcc21abb385b73dcbc283ba/2024/SPIP%20porte_plume%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-7954)/SPIP%20porte_plume%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-7954).md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b62b50d92d0b3ee610b9fb31ecabdafac333bb58/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-7954.json","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-wiki/blob/904905576ec32934bcdc63be3b528df30a65c430/docs/POC/SPIP/SPIP-porte_plume%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8FPHP%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-7954).md","https://github.com/Chocapikk/CVE-2024-7954","https://github.com/gh-ost00/CVE-2024-7954-RCE","https://github.com/bigb0x/CVE-2024-7954","https://github.com/TheCyberguy-17/RCE_CVE-2024-7954","https://github.com/0dayan0n/RCE_CVE-2024-7954-","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-7954"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0444","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0444.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"捷易联 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台 未授权敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"捷易联（JieLink）JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台在多个接口（如 /Report/ParkCommon/GetParkInThroughDeivces）处存在未授权敏感信息泄露漏洞。该平台的停车相关接口未对访问进行身份认证与权限校验，攻击者在无需登录的情况下，仅需向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求即可直接获取设备通行记录、终端及停车场内部敏感数据。该漏洞影响部署了 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台的设备，攻击条件为攻击者能够网络访问目标系统的 Web 服务端口，利用方式简单，可通过常规浏览器或脚本发起请求，可能导致内部运营信息泄露，存在一定安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-05bc23e4"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-23","updated":"2024-08-23","remediation":"在 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台前端部署反向代理或 WAF，对 /Report/ 等敏感接口增加身份认证与访问权限校验；限制接口仅允许内网可信 IP 访问，关闭不必要的外网映射端口，并升级至厂商发布的安全修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.hwpocteam.com/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0444.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0440","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0440.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"微商城系统 api.php 文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"微商城系统 api.php 存在文件上传漏洞，其文件上传接口 /api/api.php?mod=upload&type=1 未对上传文件类型与内容进行严格校验，攻击者可构造 multipart/form-data 请求上传包含 PHP 代码的恶意文件（如 rce.php），上传后该文件可被 Web 服务器解析执行，导致远程代码执行。攻击者可借此读取服务器敏感文件、执行任意系统命令，进而完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响基于微信小程序的微商城电商系统，常用于企业级线上商城，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-05b6b99a"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-23","updated":"2026-07-19","remediation":"升级微商城系统至修复文件上传漏洞的安全版本；在 api.php 上传接口配置文件类型白名单（仅允许图片等非可执行文件）并校验文件内容；将上传文件存储至 Web 根目录之外的路径；对上传文件进行重命名与病毒扫描，禁止执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cnvd.org.cn/","https://github.com/search?q=%E5%BE%AE%E5%95%86%E5%9F%8E+api.php+%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0&type=code"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0440.toml"}]